{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24002","headline":"座中戏呈诸少年 · 白居易","name":"座中戏呈诸少年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衰容禁得无多酒，秋鬓新添几许霜。\n纵有风情应淡薄，假如老健莫夸张。\n兴来吟咏从成癖，饮後酣歌少放狂。\n不爲倚官兼挟势，因何入得少年场。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24002.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24002","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}